<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady to higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices mostly steady to higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia cash values were mostly steady to higher on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Diammonium phosphate demand was good due to exports and some early shipments of DAP out to the western wheat areas, one dealer said. Ammonia markets were steady.</p>
<p>				 Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc to up 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc to up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
